# Fingerprint HAL (Goodix GF516M).
#
# Service name and HIDL instance are unchanged from the LineageOS module:
# goodixfpd.rc restarts "vendor.fps_hal" once the daemon is up, and
# hwservicemanager starts this interface lazily when FingerprintService first
# asks for it.
#
# class late_start, not hal: this HAL is useless before goodixfingerprintd
# (class main) exists.  group: system input uhid as upstream; /dev/goodix_fp
# is owned by the daemon.
#
# "disabled" is deliberate: with the "interface" line hwservicemanager starts
# the service on the first framework request, well after the daemon is up,
# and a blob regression cannot turn into a boot-time crash loop.
#
# libgoodixfingerprintd_binder.so builds android::Parcel objects on the stack
# with Nougat's sizeof(Parcel); the vendor blob is patched for the larger
# current Parcel.
service vendor.fps_hal /vendor/bin/hw/android.hardware.biometrics.fingerprint@2.0-service.m3note
    interface android.hardware.biometrics.fingerprint@2.1::IBiometricsFingerprint default
    class late_start
    disabled
    user system
    group system input uhid
    writepid /dev/cpuset/system-background/tasks
